1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,500
TLA Shop: one host app and three remote apps, loaded at runtime

2
00:00:05,500 --> 00:00:09,500
The product list comes from remote_catalog (:3020)

3
00:00:09,500 --> 00:00:13,500
"Add to cart" writes to the shared store exposed by remote_cart

4
00:00:13,500 --> 00:00:19,500
The cart page is remote_cart; the header badge reads the same store

5
00:00:19,500 --> 00:00:24,000
Checkout is guarded by the host, so it redirects to remote_user's login form

6
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:29,000
After sign-in the host combines the cart (remote_cart) and the user (remote_user)

7
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:34,400
Place order clears the cart, and the badge drops back to 0

